1
00:00:05,161 --> 00:00:07,726
Sam: Grow. Grow... grow!

2
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:11,530
Layla: Sam... why are you yelling at dirt?

3
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:15,243
Sam: I'm not yelling. I'm motivating a tree.

4
00:00:15,547 --> 00:00:17,937
Layla: A tree. Where?

5
00:00:18,227 --> 00:00:21,417
Sam: Right there! Under the dirt. Probably huge

6
00:00:21,347 --> 00:00:22,377
by now.

7
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:24,270
Layla: When did you plant it?

8
00:00:24,593 --> 00:00:25,543
Sam: Yesterday!

9
00:00:26,073 --> 00:00:29,903
Layla: Yesterday? Sam, trees take time.

10
00:00:30,147 --> 00:00:32,617
Sam: How much time? An hour? Two hours?

11
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,390
Layla: Years.

12
00:00:38,376 --> 00:00:38,890
Sam: ...Years?

13
00:00:40,087 --> 00:00:42,157
Sam: Okay. Plan B.

14
00:00:54,170 --> 00:00:58,023
Sam: Plants love water. So... maximum water!

15
00:01:01,073 --> 00:01:03,623
Layla: Wow. Very motivating.

16
00:01:04,173 --> 00:01:06,563
Sam: Sorry! Too much?

17
00:01:06,813 --> 00:01:10,323
Layla: I'm fine. I'll just... air-dry.

18
00:01:11,160 --> 00:01:12,510
Sam: What are you making?

19
00:01:12,833 --> 00:01:13,890
Layla: A scarf.

20
00:01:14,226 --> 00:01:15,816
Sam: Cool. Done by lunch?

21
00:01:16,373 --> 00:01:17,501
Layla: Done by winter.

22
00:01:17,826 --> 00:01:21,176
Sam: Winter?! How do you live like this?

23
00:01:22,090 --> 00:01:26,096
Layla: Slowly. Knit one, purl one.

24
00:01:27,880 --> 00:01:31,150
Sam: Okay. Plan C. Every champion needs a

25
00:01:31,080 --> 00:01:32,110
coach.

26
00:01:33,480 --> 00:01:36,910
Sam: Listen, little buddy. You are strong. You

27
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:37,981
are tall.

28
00:01:38,333 --> 00:01:40,203
Sam: You are... a tree!

29
00:01:42,828 --> 00:01:44,610
Layla: I think it's taking a nap.

30
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:47,750
Sam: No naps! Champions don't nap!

31
00:01:49,780 --> 00:01:52,090
Sam: Plan D. Plant food!

32
00:01:52,507 --> 00:01:54,657
Layla: How much plant food?

33
00:01:55,013 --> 00:01:55,883
Sam: All of it.

34
00:01:58,727 --> 00:02:02,797
Layla: Sam. That's not dinner. That's a mountain.

35
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:05,470
Sam: Big tree. Big appetite.

36
00:02:06,909 --> 00:02:09,717
Layla: It smells like a big appetite.

37
00:02:15,533 --> 00:02:18,150
Sam: Plan E. Plants love music!

38
00:02:24,115 --> 00:02:26,425
Sam: Feel the beat, little buddy! Grow to

39
00:02:26,315 --> 00:02:27,099
the beat!

40
00:02:27,527 --> 00:02:30,397
Layla: Sam. It's a seed. It doesn't have

41
00:02:30,327 --> 00:02:30,981
ears.

42
00:02:31,313 --> 00:02:33,303
Sam: Then it'll feel the bass!

43
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:38,670
Layla: I think it prefers jazz.

44
00:02:43,747 --> 00:02:47,817
Sam: Plan F. More sun. Way more sun.

45
00:02:49,060 --> 00:02:51,610
Layla: Sam. Something's smoking.

46
00:02:53,260 --> 00:02:54,530
Sam: That's the growing!

47
00:02:54,780 --> 00:02:56,690
Sam: That is not the growing!

48
00:02:58,807 --> 00:03:00,637
Layla: You almost cooked it.

49
00:03:01,214 --> 00:03:02,804
Sam: ...Crispy tree?

50
00:03:04,460 --> 00:03:06,930
Sam: Fine. Let's ask the internet.

51
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:11,350
Sam: How... to grow... a tree... fast.

52
00:03:11,994 --> 00:03:15,504
Sam: Step one: be patient?! ...One star!

53
00:03:15,894 --> 00:03:17,804
Layla: You're reviewing nature?

54
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:19,910
Sam: Nature needs feedback.

55
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:25,070
Sam: Step two: be more patient?! ...Zero stars!

56
00:03:25,427 --> 00:03:26,937
Layla: That's not a thing.

57
00:03:27,914 --> 00:03:29,024
Sam: It is now.

58
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:32,510
Sam: Fine. I'll sit right here... and watch

59
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:32,910
it.

60
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:45,701
Layla: You know... a watched pot never boils.

61
00:03:46,047 --> 00:03:48,997
Sam: That's for pots, Layla. Trees are totally

62
00:03:48,927 --> 00:03:50,917
different. Trees are—

63
00:03:51,480 --> 00:03:54,190
Sam: ...What? What's that face?

64
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:03,150
Sam: Did it just... move?

65
00:04:03,993 --> 00:04:05,903
Layla: Maybe it's shy.

66
00:04:06,660 --> 00:04:09,450
Sam: Shy? Trees aren't shy.

67
00:04:10,613 --> 00:04:11,163
Sam: Wait.

68
00:04:12,747 --> 00:04:16,337
Sam: It only grows... when nobody's looking.

69
00:04:16,993 --> 00:04:19,623
Layla: Or... it just needs time.

70
00:04:20,253 --> 00:04:23,043
Sam: Layla. This calls for a plan.

71
00:04:26,047 --> 00:04:29,157
Sam: Operation Don't Look. Step one: we pretend

72
00:04:29,087 --> 00:04:29,877
to leave.

73
00:04:30,047 --> 00:04:33,317
Sam: Step two: we hide. Step three: we

74
00:04:33,287 --> 00:04:34,597
catch it growing!

75
00:04:35,060 --> 00:04:37,850
Layla: Step four: we wait?

76
00:04:38,194 --> 00:04:39,864
Sam: Four is not a real step.

77
00:04:40,927 --> 00:04:44,997
Sam: Well! Bye, tree! Going far away! Very

78
00:04:44,927 --> 00:04:45,717
far!

79
00:04:49,420 --> 00:04:51,250
Sam: Ha! ...Ha?

80
00:04:52,494 --> 00:04:54,484
Layla: You were gone for two seconds.

81
00:04:54,933 --> 00:04:56,750
Sam: Two very long seconds.

82
00:05:01,147 --> 00:05:05,057
Sam: Good afternoon. I am... not Sam. Just

83
00:05:04,987 --> 00:05:06,849
a guy. Looking at trees.

84
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:08,470
Layla: Hi, Sam.

85
00:05:08,794 --> 00:05:09,532
Sam: Dang it.

86
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,533
Layla: Hi, Sam.

87
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:22,870
Sam: Shh! I'm a bush.

88
00:05:23,327 --> 00:05:25,717
Layla: Bushes don't wear scarves.

89
00:05:26,740 --> 00:05:28,330
Sam: Fashionable bush.

90
00:05:29,350 --> 00:05:30,764
Sam: Ow! Rude bird!

91
00:05:34,327 --> 00:05:36,717
Sam: Three minutes?! Who has that kind of

92
00:05:36,807 --> 00:05:37,277
time?

93
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:40,390
Layla: You could just... wait.

94
00:05:42,180 --> 00:05:42,890
Sam: Never.

95
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:46,390
Sam: Trees can't hide from technology.

96
00:05:51,847 --> 00:05:53,757
Sam: Okay. Let's see the footage!

97
00:05:54,394 --> 00:05:58,224
Sam: Is it growing? ...Now? ...How about now?

98
00:05:59,060 --> 00:06:02,730
Layla: Great footage. Very... you.

99
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:07,030
Sam: Huh. I'm in every shot.

100
00:06:08,374 --> 00:06:12,444
Sam: Big brain move. I look... without looking.

101
00:06:18,414 --> 00:06:20,884
Layla: It can see the mirror, Sam.

102
00:06:21,247 --> 00:06:23,501
Sam: This tree is a genius.

103
00:06:24,527 --> 00:06:27,077
Sam: New plan. If it won't grow up...

104
00:06:27,007 --> 00:06:28,517
I'll help it up.

105
00:06:29,140 --> 00:06:31,850
Layla: Sam. If you pull it... you'll pull

106
00:06:31,780 --> 00:06:32,970
it out.

107
00:06:36,534 --> 00:06:38,937
Sam: ...Fine. No pulling.

108
00:06:41,767 --> 00:06:44,504
Layla: It's getting late. Go home, Sam. Get

109
00:06:44,434 --> 00:06:45,624
some sleep.

110
00:06:46,060 --> 00:06:48,290
Sam: Sleep is for people who already have

111
00:06:48,580 --> 00:06:49,250
trees.

112
00:06:49,807 --> 00:06:51,397
Layla: Goodnight, Sam.

113
00:06:52,060 --> 00:06:54,770
Sam: Goodnight, Layla. Goodnight, tree.

114
00:06:55,327 --> 00:06:56,917
Sam: I'm watching you.

115
00:07:04,993 --> 00:07:07,223
Sam: Just you and me, buddy. I'm not

116
00:07:07,113 --> 00:07:07,664
blinking.

117
00:07:10,904 --> 00:07:13,991
Sam: Not blinking... not sleeping...

118
00:07:16,936 --> 00:07:18,536
Sam: I'm up! I'm up.

119
00:07:21,193 --> 00:07:25,423
Sam: Maybe I'll count sheep. One sheep... two

120
00:07:25,353 --> 00:07:26,623
sheep...

121
00:07:28,193 --> 00:07:31,943
Sam: Three... tree... trees...

122
00:07:37,993 --> 00:07:39,201
Layla: Goodnight, Sam.

123
00:07:40,050 --> 00:07:42,079
Layla: And you... take your time.

124
00:08:12,627 --> 00:08:14,018
Layla: Good morning, Sam.

125
00:08:14,247 --> 00:08:16,957
Sam: I wasn't sleeping! I was... resting my

126
00:08:16,887 --> 00:08:17,757
eyes.

127
00:08:18,294 --> 00:08:19,964
Layla: For eight hours.

128
00:08:21,387 --> 00:08:25,137
Sam: Whoa. It grew... without me.

129
00:08:25,674 --> 00:08:28,144
Layla: Mostly because you were asleep.

130
00:08:28,650 --> 00:08:30,664
Sam: But where are the apples? I want

131
00:08:30,674 --> 00:08:32,440
apples. Now!

132
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:36,590
Layla: Hey, Sam. Look! A bird!

133
00:08:36,794 --> 00:08:37,904
Sam: Where?!

134
00:08:42,347 --> 00:08:44,417
Sam: It... grew.

135
00:08:46,074 --> 00:08:46,990
Sam: It grew!

136
00:08:47,527 --> 00:08:50,198
Layla: Told you. It just needed time.

137
00:08:51,047 --> 00:08:54,477
Sam: Okay! Next up: a whole forest!

138
00:08:55,247 --> 00:08:56,143
Sam: ...How long?

139
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:58,390
Layla: Years.

140
00:09:21,540 --> 00:09:22,668
Layla: Done by winter.

141
00:09:23,575 --> 00:09:24,783
Sam: Show-off.

142
00:09:34,987 --> 00:09:35,697
Sam: Grow.

143
00:09:36,940 --> 00:09:37,989
Layla: No yelling?

144
00:09:38,473 --> 00:09:40,463
Sam: Nah. It knows what to do.

